the evil? With all these questions, Feng Ling’er and the white hair girl somehow seem like they don’t care a bit. They simply continue with their wander, not knowing that something big is about to happen…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oFI4QPeDLopcXqsK4Tf3CzFzfEl.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"94286","synopsis":"白钰袖和崔公子被黑心船家暗算，关入船内监牢。风铃儿潜入相救。同时她们发现船上还有多方势力蓄势待发，沉香木燕的出现也似乎预示着背后隐藏了不可告人的秘密。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1EqWkQlFEyiMbt277pJdvxAH0oz.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"94287","synopsis":"风铃儿、白钰袖和崔公子三人来到了茶花镇，从路人口中听说了船上“青龙会”的事情，与此同时，他们被一群蒙面人盯上，半夜遭到了围攻，白钰袖在打伤其中一人后得知了其身份为卖艺团伙。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AkjMvbhdDMOcTSq3wQpDrt8up6y.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"94288","synopsis":"卖艺团伙仓皇而逃，将白钰袖等人引诱至梨园，三人被困于五情绝杀阵内，白钰袖身中寒阴五失散经脉被封，为了拖延时间疗毒，崔公子和风铃儿开始与卖艺人进行对决。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nqInMJRPszt8Uwy86mCsQ77yL8k.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"94289","synopsis":"在白钰袖刚与吴班长分出胜负之时，青龙会四首之一历荣杀入梨园并驱散了戏班子，但在出手之际却被一直尾随的穹武剑阁二人以及崔府莫二拦下，最终与前来助阵的黑煞离去。而风铃儿三人与穹武剑阁二人在莫二的邀请下来到崔府。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ilVHQP9NLMT0kYvLFiLuvLlBPQD.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"94290","synopsis":"在崔府，剑阁二人告知风铃儿两人密盒中乃是多年前魔门长生宗研制的红阳血精，并在白钰袖答应血精由剑阁二人代为保管后带血精离开。用餐时，由于管家言语不善，风铃儿离席，并与追来的白钰袖一同回忆起了两人的初遇。在两人回崔府的路上，被黑煞带走了风铃儿。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wc2zqkzmwNy3tMaZTsOXQaVXBNo.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"94291","synopsis":"从昏迷中醒来的白钰袖告知了众人风铃儿的下落。夜晚，前来试探白钰袖身份的崔老爷得知其母为“小城主”，之后，为化解黑煞留在心脉真气的白钰袖护阵。白钰袖欲运转心法第三层无相时，心神见到了一个欲取代自己的“白钰袖”，一番大战后，顿悟了无相的白钰袖获胜并突破至宗师境。崔老爷在护阵时受伤，给了白钰袖一把剑做为信物并留在了崔府。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f1sLe5Yxo4Ke5LNyfLzAha7dlau.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"94292","synopsis":"在落日崖，风铃儿被黑叶枯花下了金蝉蛊毒。潜入落日崖准备救人的白钰袖遇到了前来复仇的戏班子吴班长，吴班长被白钰袖的义气打动，提出愿意提供帮助。另一边，被下了蛊毒的风铃儿被逼问起了关于沉飞燕的事，风铃儿回忆起了和沉飞燕的相遇，但是什么都没有说，危机时刻，白钰袖和吴班长及时赶到，战胜了黑叶枯花，但最后关头风铃儿却消失不见。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jyjdQPReXyDJSOfn84b82GCaDIZ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"94293","synopsis":"白钰袖与赶来的“黑煞”陷入了苦战，另一边，救走了风铃儿的柳如烟帮助风铃儿压制了体内的毒素，苏醒后的风铃儿得知白钰袖来救自己而赶了回去，与白钰袖一同战胜了“黑煞”，此时“黑煞”却揭下了人皮面具，露出了另一副面孔，并重新出手战胜了风铃儿和白钰袖，危机关头，柳如烟赶到救下了二人。两人在与柳如烟交谈之时，南笙等人赶来支援柳如烟，柳如烟认风铃儿为义妹并让南笙帮忙解毒。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dHIr2jQjBNtXmIWzLoVqk4EZ00A.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"94294","synopsis":"吴班长经脉损失严重，在得知柳如烟手中的黑玉断续膏可以治疗后，吴班长接受了柳如烟提出的宗师境前效力于天涯海阁十年的条件。南笙帮风铃儿解开了蛊毒后，玩闹间提出了惊喜赌约，随后风铃儿被柳如烟叫走，并告知了自己与沉飞燕的关系。崔府之中，崔老爷给了崔玉武功心法并将其关在了密室，随后与管家一起静待其变。在夜晚的惊喜赌约中，风铃儿的“火树银花不夜天”最终取得了胜利。随后柳如烟有事离去，并让南笙暗中护送前去崔府还剑的风铃儿二人。崔府之中，来了三位不速之客。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/41L1DDcenSExCx970wsuf5HVXVs.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"94295","synopsis":"崔府，魔刀孔秦三人向崔老爷索要无相城仙人图，遭拒后其中两人与莫二大打出手，在莫二使用金刚气劲废了两人各一手后，两人服用了改良的红阳血精。另一边，骑马赶路的风铃儿二人在临近崔府时发现了崔府那边的动静。莫二不及服用血精后的二人，崔老爷被迫出手，激战间，孔秦出手重创莫二，随后三人共同围攻崔老爷，危机关头白钰袖率先赶到对崔老爷出手相助，两人联手之下孔秦三人节节败退，白钰袖乘胜追击时却被反制，服用血精二人欲废其武功时，白钰袖“心魔”发作反杀二人。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aOPF3TdBHcT7tLGzVpwEpXA4Ms7.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"94296","synopsis":"“心魔”发作的白钰袖自行凝结出了红阳血精，孔秦出手抢夺，却被白钰袖撕掉了拿着红阳血精的胳膊，随即逃走。白钰袖伤了崔老爷后风铃儿与南笙赶到控制住了白钰袖。昏迷中的白钰袖发现“心魔”其实并不简单，“心魔”告诉白钰袖，功成圆满之时白钰袖会知道自己是谁。白钰袖苏醒后，由于红阳血精的缘故，记不清进入崔府之后的事，随后崔老爷告知白钰袖一年前白沐贞在南疆出现过，并说出了西王剑的渊源并托白钰袖将其带给白沐贞。之后风铃儿二人与南笙以及半路赶上的崔玉一同前往南疆。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7xcpEkhZGz2pxrz5CIoJ2WR2mRx.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":101843,"malId":36184},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:101843","mal:36184"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13447","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101843","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"36184","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":6476,"title":"Feng Ling Yu Xiu","title_eng":"Soulmate Adventure","slug":"soulmate-adventure","plot":"Si dice che una misteriosa ragazza dai capelli bianchi si sia improvvisamente alleata con la famosa ladra Feng Linger. La sua abilità è tale da aver sconfitto numerosi maestri di arti marziali del mondo sotterraneo. La gente non può fare a meno di chiedersi chi sia e dove abbia ricevuto un addestramento così straordinario. Ma soprattutto, sta dalla parte del bene o del male? Mentre questi interrogativi si diffondono, Feng Linger e la ragazza dai capelli bianchi sembrano non curarsene affatto. Proseguono semplicemente il loro viaggio, ignare della grande cospirazione che sta per travolgerle.","type":"ONA","status":"Terminato","date":"2017","studio":"Sunflowers","dub":0,"mal_id":36184,"anilist_id":101843,"imageurl":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx101843-mh2pT7wP4fw6.jpg","imageurl_cover":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/101843-6eWQtGDiZk6e.jpg","cover":null,"score":"7.00","episodes_count":12,"genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Martial Arts"],"related":[{"id":6476,"title":"Feng Ling Yu Xiu","title_eng":"Soulmate Adventure","type":"ONA","date":"2017","episodes_count":12},{"id":6477,"title":"Feng Ling Yu Xiu